# name: open_explore
# description: roam toward the most open space, avoiding obstacles
# triggers: explore, open explore, roam, wander, find open space, explore the room, go explore, find space
# plan: pick the emptiest nearby spot@EXPLORE | drive there avoiding obstacles@EXPLORE
#
# Repeatedly heads to the emptiest nearby spot — the point on a ~2 m ring around
# the robot with the FEWEST lidar returns near it (most open) — and drives there
# in obstacle-aware move mode, so it roams into open areas without hitting things.
# Runs until you press Stop.

PRINT "Exploring — heading for open space. Press Stop to end."
SET r = EXPLORE()
PRINT "Done exploring."
